OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into 'unexplained'
OL,4,Adeath of 18-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say an 18-year-old man who was
OL,7,Freported missing earlier this week has
OL,8,Fbeen found dead.
OL,10,FJames Corlett, from Swadlincote in
OL,11,FDerbyshire, did not return home
OL,12,Ffollowing a night out in
OL,13,FAshby-de-la-Zouch, Leicestershire, on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FA missing person inquiry was launched
OL,17,Fby Derbyshire Police and transferred to
OL,18,Fthe neighbouring Leicestershire force
OL,19,Fon Saturday, which confirmed a body had
OL,20,Fbeen found in the town.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
